Package: localthumbs-cli
Version: 1.1.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: ffmpeg
Recommends: nodejs (>= 18)
Maintainer: hersche <vinzenz.hersche@gmail.com>
Description: Local thumbnail generator worker for Nextcloud
 Scans a Nextcloud instance via WebDAV, generates video thumbnails
 locally with FFmpeg and uploads them to the localthumbs Nextcloud
 app. Supports multiple Nextcloud accounts with separate caches.
